WEBVTT

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:05.450
Why you want to become a scary king,

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:07.950
that I don't know.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.420
But, how I feel about you...

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:20.210
I want to help you with whatever
you're dealing with.

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:40.440
I'm back!

00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:43.280
-You idiot!
-Say what now?

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:46.280
Just where have you been all this time?

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:48.910
Sorry.

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:54.210
You didn't turn into a dragon, did you?

00:00:55.710 --> 00:01:00.130
Of course not. Well, I'm off to bed.

00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:02.010
She sure is acting fishy.

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:05.470
What in the world was Afro doing?

00:01:13.270 --> 00:01:14.730
Nina.

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:17.230
Oh, it's just you, Master.

00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:20.110
Don't startle me like that.

00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:23.900
Looks like you fell for a guy who's real trouble.

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:30.280
You met with Charioce, right?

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:34.160
What are you talking about, Master?
Of course I didn't.

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:38.040
I see.

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:39.460
You're right.

00:01:39.670 --> 00:01:44.260
There's no way a little shrimp like you
could hook a king.

00:01:44.590 --> 00:01:46.970
You're right, Master.

00:01:47.220 --> 00:01:49.550
Don't be crazy.

00:01:49.720 --> 00:01:51.510
Sorry, sorry.

00:02:02.190 --> 00:02:03.190
Get out of the way.

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:07.610
Oh, it's you.

00:02:07.780 --> 00:02:09.870
Where have you been?

00:02:10.030 --> 00:02:12.830
Our group got a little bigger while you were gone.

00:02:12.990 --> 00:02:15.460
I am not part of your pathetic group.

00:02:15.870 --> 00:02:18.960
Azazel, I'm glad you're okay.

00:02:21.130 --> 00:02:24.920
I'm sorry that I couldn't turn into a dragon
when you needed me to.

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:30.180
If only I'd turned into a dragon then.

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:34.520
It doesn't matter whether
you turn into a dragon or not.

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:38.640
I never expected anything out of you.

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:03.340
Oh, Azazel.

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:05.800
Mugaro's back too.

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:09.300
He's a bit more grown up, but you should
still be able to recognize him.

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:25.650
Didn't Azazel recognize you?

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:41.170
RAGE OF BAHAMUT

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:43.880
They are the same
and lose themselves

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:46.590
Cuz there are lots of roads to go

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:52.430
And the path suddenly seems rougher

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:57.520
I wanna walk straight ahead
Knock down another dream

00:03:57.680 --> 00:04:03.100
Most broke before they ever came true

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:07.150
But walk this way

00:04:08.730 --> 00:04:12.660
Get out of my way

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:20.250
Depends on the way you think it
To a yielding heart

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:24.920
the future, hope,
despair and worry all look all the same

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:31.220
So much that you'll turn down the truth
that lied to you that day

00:04:31.380 --> 00:04:35.930
when you were prepared for it all.
You go your way, don't you?

00:04:36.390 --> 00:04:40.390
But walk this way

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:45.610
Get out of my way

00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:51.150
But walk this way

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:10.880
How did the prison island look?

00:05:11.090 --> 00:05:13.010
I was watching from the sky,

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:15.760
but there was no opening to get any closer.

00:05:15.970 --> 00:05:20.720
The city was full of soldiers, too,
maybe in response to your escape.

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:25.020
Wow, you two were actually working for a change.

00:05:25.190 --> 00:05:28.980
The only people who were playing around
were you, Afro, and Azazel.

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:31.280
Sorry.

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:34.700
Is the intel on the bracelet really our only lead?

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:39.450
Do we even know if the king
always has the bracelet on?

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:44.500
It seems like he always has the bracelet on.

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:46.210
How do you know that?

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:52.000
Oh, because I think he had it on
when I ran into him at the prison.

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:54.970
Even if that's true,

00:05:55.130 --> 00:05:58.010
how are we supposed to even get near the king?

00:05:58.220 --> 00:06:01.470
There's going to be a ball at the palace in four days.

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:02.640
Is that true?

00:06:02.810 --> 00:06:04.890
I heard it from a former patient who's a noble.

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:06.060
It's reliable.

00:06:06.230 --> 00:06:08.150
I didn't know you treated nobles too.

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:10.610
I'll treat anybody as long as they pay me.

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:13.610
Should we try to move in on the king at the ball?

00:06:13.820 --> 00:06:16.650
We'll need help if we're
going to sneak into the ball.

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:18.700
What about your former patient?

00:06:18.860 --> 00:06:22.490
He's from a third-rate family.
No way he's getting an invitation.

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:23.790
Well, that's no good.

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:25.370
Please leave this to me.

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:31.340
Okay, then who is going to be the one sneaking in?

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:32.840
Me!

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:36.300
I'll sneak into the ball
and steal the bracelet from the king.

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:39.470
What's wrong?

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:41.010
It's not very reassuring.

00:06:41.180 --> 00:06:44.470
You're better suited for the
jobs where you can go wild.

00:06:45.310 --> 00:06:49.650
It'll be fine. I've learned how to turn into a dragon
whenever I want to now.

00:06:49.810 --> 00:06:52.860
Stop lying. We're not playing around here.

00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:54.900
Now stay out of it.

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:11.710
It seems like she wasn't lying.

00:07:11.880 --> 00:07:16.130
I noticed she was fine being next to Kaisar too.

00:07:16.760 --> 00:07:20.550
Does that mean you no longer
get flustered around men?

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:33.150
See?

00:07:35.690 --> 00:07:36.730
Why?

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:38.740
Why now?

00:07:41.490 --> 00:07:42.990
I'm sorry.

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:45.740
It's because I learned what it feels like to be loved.

00:08:05.140 --> 00:08:08.220
We need 30 percent more energy

00:08:08.390 --> 00:08:11.190
in order to activate Dromos at maximum output.

00:08:11.350 --> 00:08:12.730
Finish the task, then.

00:08:12.940 --> 00:08:16.150
But, Your Majesty, the workers need to rest.

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:18.480
They are being generously compensated.

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:19.820
Do it.

00:08:23.780 --> 00:08:25.530
Aye yai yai...

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:27.240
Your Majesty.

00:08:27.410 --> 00:08:30.290
May I give you my report as well?

00:08:30.450 --> 00:08:31.750
Very well.

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:34.330
We received word that the red dragon
was spotted last night.

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:39.090
They say it was brazenly flying over Anatae.

00:08:39.260 --> 00:08:40.840
Enough of this charade.

00:08:52.850 --> 00:08:54.900
We, the Onyx Soldiers,

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:58.440
offer our lives to serve Your Majesty.

00:08:59.020 --> 00:09:02.740
Please, give us the order.

00:09:02.900 --> 00:09:04.860
I know.

00:09:14.210 --> 00:09:15.830
The red dragon?

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:17.590
We have not located it yet.

00:09:17.790 --> 00:09:19.500
It will appear without fail.

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:21.130
It won't be long.

00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:23.920
The man we've discussed will arrive tonight.

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:26.720
He's quick. Have the money ready.

00:09:26.890 --> 00:09:28.050
Yes sir.

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:32.310
Oh, hello.

00:09:33.560 --> 00:09:35.100
Could I have a moment?

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:38.770
Do not tolerate Charioce's arrogance!

00:09:39.020 --> 00:09:41.190
You there, what are you doing?!

00:09:42.070 --> 00:09:44.780
-Hey!
-Stop right there!

00:09:49.910 --> 00:09:51.240
Stop!

00:10:23.730 --> 00:10:25.190
Hey.

00:10:48.630 --> 00:10:50.340
Find him.

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:58.080
I'm the bounty being called the rag demon.

00:11:58.250 --> 00:12:02.080
I will slay the king of man and
take back the pride the demons have lost.

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:03.790
I will use the red dragon.

00:12:03.960 --> 00:12:05.540
All we can do is trust you.

00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:09.380
Azazel, what is it that you are looking upon?

00:12:10.800 --> 00:12:12.510
The future.

00:12:14.300 --> 00:12:15.300
I'm sorry.

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:21.890
I'm sorry I wasn't able to help you then.

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:33.490
You're apologizing to me as well?

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:39.830
You have nothing to apologize for.

00:12:51.090 --> 00:12:54.890
RAGE OF BAHAMUT

00:12:56.140 --> 00:12:57.720
Come in. Right this way.

00:13:00.850 --> 00:13:03.310
How long are you going to be making that face?

00:13:03.480 --> 00:13:06.480
It's not like we come here every night.

00:13:06.730 --> 00:13:09.360
We devote ourselves to our hard training and duties.

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:12.190
Are we not allowed any simple pleasures?

00:13:12.530 --> 00:13:14.150
Of course you are.

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:15.990
Then come on.

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:17.830
Sit down. Make yourself comfortable.

00:13:17.990 --> 00:13:20.200
But if the captain saw us like this...

00:13:20.370 --> 00:13:22.200
What? How the hell would he do that!

00:13:27.130 --> 00:13:28.380
Alessand.

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:30.630
Of course he won't see us.

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:33.760
He's too busy being a wanted fugitive.

00:13:35.760 --> 00:13:36.840
Hey, there.

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:39.510
Cerby is here to cheer you up.

00:13:40.470 --> 00:13:43.520
Oh, Cerby, I've missed you so much.

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:44.940
Oh, Al.

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:47.860
You know I'm mad at you
for not coming by at all lately.

00:13:48.270 --> 00:13:49.650
Okay, okay! I'm sorry!

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:53.070
Now, how about you try to relax and enjoy yourself?

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:55.610
Come on, what do you say?

00:13:59.320 --> 00:14:02.910
Oh, are you okay, Al?

00:14:05.040 --> 00:14:07.170
Ah...

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:09.420
Could I have a moment?

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:12.960
I...

00:14:14.050 --> 00:14:16.300
If you have something to say, say it already.

00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:21.560
I'd like to join the Onyx Soldiers.

00:14:24.770 --> 00:14:25.850
Please wait.

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:27.980
I'm serious.

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:30.610
The Orleans Knights are done for.

00:14:32.190 --> 00:14:33.190
You are not worth it.

00:14:33.360 --> 00:14:34.860
What? Worth?

00:14:35.070 --> 00:14:38.610
You are not worth adding to our squad.

00:14:55.510 --> 00:14:56.920
Oh, Al.

00:14:57.340 --> 00:15:00.340
This is his first day with us today.

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:06.270
You've got a real annoying face.

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:09.270
-Excuse me?
-No, don't "excuse me."

00:15:09.480 --> 00:15:11.060
You've gotta stop it with that face.

00:15:11.230 --> 00:15:12.230
Hey.

00:15:12.980 --> 00:15:15.360
-I told you to stop.
-Excuse me?

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:32.580
What are you doing, Alessand?

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:45.470
What?

00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:47.220
Why are...

00:15:55.520 --> 00:15:58.690
Why were you here in disguise?

00:15:59.240 --> 00:16:00.950
I wanted to see you.

00:16:01.150 --> 00:16:05.830
So you must have known
that we frequent places like this.

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:08.580
I'm your superior officer.

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:15.210
There's something I'd like your help with.

00:16:15.670 --> 00:16:18.300
I would be happy to do whatever I can.

00:16:19.460 --> 00:16:20.760
Alessand.

00:16:21.220 --> 00:16:23.300
I would like your help as well.

00:16:25.970 --> 00:16:29.850
You know of the weapon
His Majesty used, don't you?

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:33.850
If His Majesty wishes to use its power
for further conflict,

00:16:34.020 --> 00:16:35.400
then I would like to stop him.

00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:37.360
But how?

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:39.780
The palace ball that will be held in three days.

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:41.860
I will infiltrate it.

00:16:42.070 --> 00:16:43.780
That is where, Alessand...

00:16:44.530 --> 00:16:46.830
I would like your help.

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:51.120
Only select nobles may attend the ball.

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:53.420
Being from the great Visponti family,

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:55.630
that should be no trouble for you.

00:16:57.090 --> 00:17:00.380
Please, I need your help.

00:17:02.090 --> 00:17:04.430
-Alessand.
-No way.

00:17:04.590 --> 00:17:07.640
-What?
-I said, I don't want to.

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:10.180
Why do I have to help you, anyway?

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:12.770
Do you have any idea what your situation is?

00:17:12.940 --> 00:17:14.770
You're a traitor, a fugitive,

00:17:14.940 --> 00:17:16.730
and on the kingdom's most-wanted list.

00:17:16.940 --> 00:17:18.940
Why would I do any favors for someone like that?

00:17:19.110 --> 00:17:21.280
-Alessand.
-And you're no better, Dias.

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:24.700
-How can you keep licking his boots?
-Enough.

00:17:24.860 --> 00:17:28.160
He ruined our lives.

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:30.040
Why aren't you mad?

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:32.410
I'm sorry.

00:17:32.620 --> 00:17:35.370
It's too late for apologies.

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:39.250
The Orleans Knights can never
get back what we've lost.

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:43.590
We've been reduced to being worthless!

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:48.640
You are not worthless.

00:17:49.640 --> 00:17:51.640
You are my prized subordinates.

00:17:54.810 --> 00:17:56.690
I am fully to blame for everything.

00:17:57.190 --> 00:17:58.440
However...

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:02.280
This is something I desperately need your help with.

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:05.700
Even if I should lose my life,

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:08.280
I must know His Majesty's intentions.

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:12.830
Please.

00:18:21.170 --> 00:18:22.840
Just so you know,

00:18:23.010 --> 00:18:25.010
I'm not doing anything dangerous.

00:18:26.840 --> 00:18:27.840
Thank you.

00:18:30.010 --> 00:18:31.010
Hey.

00:18:31.180 --> 00:18:33.140
What are you doing, Dias?

00:18:33.310 --> 00:18:34.560
Stop it.

00:18:34.730 --> 00:18:37.810
-You're grossing me out.
-What are you blushing for?

00:18:37.980 --> 00:18:38.980
I'm not blushing.

00:19:17.980 --> 00:19:22.190
I love you!

00:19:22.400 --> 00:19:25.190
I love you!

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:29.200
-I love you!
-So noisy.

00:19:30.740 --> 00:19:32.990
-Oh, my goodness, I said it.
-What are you doing?

00:19:33.740 --> 00:19:35.910
Master? What are you doing here?

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:40.370
I came to see what all this commotion was about.

00:19:40.540 --> 00:19:44.290
It's nothing, so you can go back now.

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:48.260
Who gave you that?

00:19:49.130 --> 00:19:50.630
This? What?

00:19:50.800 --> 00:19:52.590
Don't look, pervert.

00:19:52.760 --> 00:19:55.310
Pervert? What?

00:19:56.890 --> 00:19:58.730
Hey, Nina.

00:19:59.310 --> 00:20:02.100
I don't care what you're hiding.

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:04.770
Just make sure you think hard before you act.

00:20:07.360 --> 00:20:10.900
The world is put together pretty carefully.

00:20:11.950 --> 00:20:14.990
When you choose one thing,
you lose something else.

00:20:16.030 --> 00:20:18.950
That's why I decided to avoid all the nonsense,

00:20:19.120 --> 00:20:21.960
and live my life as a bounty hunter,
free to do what I wanted.

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:27.710
But even then, there are times when
you have to make important decisions.

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:29.210
Master?

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:31.300
Even now.

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:34.180
Did I make the right decision?

00:20:34.930 --> 00:20:37.470
I just don't know.

00:20:40.180 --> 00:20:44.400
That's why you need to decide well,
so you don't have any regrets later.

00:20:44.560 --> 00:20:46.400
I don't really get what you're saying.

00:20:48.780 --> 00:20:50.780
You love Charioce, don't you?

00:20:55.950 --> 00:20:57.030
I can't say.

00:20:57.950 --> 00:20:59.580
I see.

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:06.420
I love you!

00:21:06.590 --> 00:21:09.090
Hey, stop that, Master.

00:21:09.250 --> 00:21:10.260
Okay, okay.

00:21:10.420 --> 00:21:13.010
I love you!

00:21:13.180 --> 00:21:16.010
Stop that right now!

00:21:16.180 --> 00:21:17.600
I love you!

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:20.640
-Shut up! Shut up!
-Stop! Seriously! Stop!

00:21:20.810 --> 00:21:22.390
-Watch it! Come on!
-I'm pushing you off!

00:21:23.640 --> 00:21:26.150
They're so obnoxious.

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:46.040
As horrible as you are
I can't help but love you

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:53.840
Even while I waited
That is all I felt

00:21:54.220 --> 00:22:02.100
Ephemeral lovers, both flawed and missing pieces
We have finally become one

00:22:02.390 --> 00:22:09.480
in this miniature garden at the edge of sorrow
Can you hear my heart speaking?

00:22:10.190 --> 00:22:17.740
Ah, I may no longer feel
that I want to go back in time

00:22:18.240 --> 00:22:25.250
But there are feelings, feelings, feelings
I can only feel now

00:22:25.410 --> 00:22:33.380
I want to run away with you, dancing
just like in a fairy tale

00:22:33.630 --> 00:22:41.350
Don't tell me it will only be this once, darling
I am on the same ark

00:22:42.390 --> 00:22:45.770
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Yeah

00:22:46.270 --> 00:22:50.310
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Cinderella step

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:53.730
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Yeah

00:22:53.940 --> 00:22:57.740
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Cinderella step

00:22:57.900 --> 00:22:58.910
Yeah

00:23:12.590 --> 00:23:14.250
I'm glad you came.

00:23:14.460 --> 00:23:16.130
Do you have the money?

00:23:18.760 --> 00:23:20.220
This is all?

00:23:20.390 --> 00:23:21.890
I asked for more.

00:23:22.050 --> 00:23:23.970
Half for now.

00:23:24.140 --> 00:23:27.140
We'll pay the rest when we've confirmed the kill.

00:23:28.730 --> 00:23:30.850
I see you're taking extra precautions.

00:23:39.360 --> 00:23:43.280
So where is this red dragon?

00:23:46.950 --> 00:23:50.290
This is El.
I bet you were wondering when I'll talk!

00:23:50.460 --> 00:23:54.340
I was waiting for my moment to shine!

00:23:54.540 --> 00:23:58.050
